From 4a95f4621ba30f1a390c86fd801a2d743cd33374 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: StavroMueller <jcliff90@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 21:42:46 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] New port: FiiO M3 Pro (Ingenic X1000E)

Native port for the FiiO M3 Pro, based on the Shanling Q1 target. Every
board-specific value was read from a retail unit (stock OS over ADB, live
register reads via devmem) or from FiiO's FW1.1.1 kernel; see the notes
in the porting repo for the decoding.

Hardware:
- LCD: X1000 SLCD (16-bit) -> SSD1963 -> ST7701S 480x800 panel, showing
  columns 70..409 as a 340x800 display. Both init tables transcribed
  from the stock kernel; the ST7701S is set up over bit-banged 3-wire SPI.
- Touch: new driver for the Hynitron CST3xx (drivers/cst3xx.c).
- Keys: four GPIO keys (power, vol+, vol-, play), Shanling Q1 keypad
  layout reused so keymaps and plugins work unchanged.
- Audio: ES9218P on I2C0 with its MCLK oscillator enable; the I2C
  address (0x48/0x49) is probed at init.
- PMU: AXP192 with the stock rail voltages (CPU core 1.225 V). LDO2/LDO3
  are set directly because axp192_supply_set_voltage() doesn't shift the
  LDO2 value into its high-nibble field.
- Backlight: PWM0 (PC25) at 10 kHz plus the PC3 supply enable.
- Headphone detect on AXP192 GPIO3 (reg 0x96 bit 4).

Also:
- Bootloader: boots the stock firmware with the stock kernel arguments;
  USB boot via jztool ("jztool fiiom3pro load"), installed with the
  bootloader's Install option.
- Touchscreen defaults to point mode.
- cabbiev2 gets a 340x800 variant.
- Simulator frame bitmap.
- Five plugins with no 340x800 layout are excluded for now (rockblox,
  bubbles, invadrox, jewels, wormlet).

Tested on hardware: USB boot, bootloader install, LCD, backlight, keys,
touch, NAND, SD card, USB storage, booting the stock firmware, Rockbox
main firmware. Not yet verified: audio output, battery curves.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
